{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03CB30","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，就算是走过一次的地方也要小心。敌人应该会藏在自然环境里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"还有，知道怎么找到带着ID卡的雇佣兵吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯，Cécile告诉我了。在有凤尾绿咬鹃鸣叫的森林里，穿橙色夹克的士兵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是研究所的士兵。应该是出来巡逻的。搜身检查一下，就能知道他有没有带ID卡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""}]}